  "title": "Snow Days Potato Soup",
  "description": "This best tasting potato soup is perfect for when the weather is bad or good. Simple to prepare, but tastes like you&#39;ve slaved away. Excellent by itself or with crackers and other favorite additions. So when you&#39;re snowed in, make up a batch and call the family around to enjoy! Thanks Mary Ella!",
